on has no backup.\""\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \""title\"": \""Release approvals\"",\n        \""summary\"": \""App store approvals are slow and nobody owns chasing them.\"",\n        \""claims\"": [\n          \""App store approvals are slow and nobody owns chasing them.\""\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \""id\"": \""s-onboarding\"",\n    \""groupType\"": \""team\"",\n    \""groupId\"": \""onboarding\"",\n    \""themes\"": [\n      {\n        \""title\"": \""Import step\"",\n        \""summary\"": \""Customers struggle with the data import step and the docs are out of date.\"",\n        \""claims\"": [\n          \""Customers struggle with the data import step.\"",\n          \""The docs are out of date.\""\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \""id\"": \""s-support\"",\n    \""groupType\"": \""team\"",\n    \""groupId\"": \""support\"",\n    \""themes\"": [\n      {\n        \""title\"": \""Post-release load\"",\n        \""summary\"": \""Ticket volume and backlog spike after releases.\"",\n        \""claims\"": [\n          \""Ticket volume spikes after releases.\"",\n          \""The ticket backlog after releases is stressful.\""\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \""title\"": \""Escalation\"",\n        \""summary\"": \""Escalation paths to engineering are unclear and slow.\"",\n        \""claims\"": [\n          \""Escalation paths are unclear.\"",\n          \""Escalation to engineering is slow.\""\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \""id\"": \""s-engineering\"",\n    \""groupType\"": \""department\"",\n    \""groupId\"": \""engineering\"",\n    \""themes\"": [\n      {\n        \""title\"": \""Release and rollout friction\"",\n        \""summary\"": \""A monthly release crunch, unclear rollback ownership, and slow app store approvals that nobody owns.\"",\n        \""claims\"": [\n          \""The monthly release train creates a last-week crunch.\"",\n          \""Rollback ownership is unclear.\"",\n          \""App store approvals are slow and nobody owns chasing them.\""\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \""title\"": \""On-call\"",\n        \""summary\"": \""On-call load is heavy and alerts are noisy.\"",\n        \""claims\"": [\n          \""On-call load is heavy.\"",\n          \""Alerts are noisy.\""\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n]\n\n\n=== src/data/teams.json ===\n{\n  \""departments\"": [\n    {\n      \""id\"": \""engineering\"",\n      \""name\"": \""Engineering\""\n    },\n    {\n      \""id\"": \""customer-success\"",\n      \""name\"": \""Customer Success\""\n    }\n  ],\n  \""teams\"": [\n    {\n      \""id\"": \""payments\"",\n      \""name\"": \""Payments\"",\n      \""departmentId\"": \""engineering\""\n    },\n    {\n      \""id\"": \""platform\"",\n      \""name\"": \""Platform\"",\n      \""departmentId\"": \""engineering\""\n    },\n    {\n      \""id\"": \""mobile\"",\n      \""name\"": \""Mobile\"",\n      \""departmentId\"": \""engineering\""\n    },\n    {\n      \""id\"": \""onboarding\"",\n      \""name\"": \""Onboarding\"",\n      \""departmentId\"": \""customer-success\""\n    },\n    {\n      \""id\"": \""support\"",\n      \""name\"": \""Support\"",\n      \""departmentId\"": \""customer-success\""\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n\n=== src/main.jsx ===\nimport { StrictMode } from \""react\"";\nimport { createRoot } from \""react-dom/client\"";\nimport App from \""./App.jsx\"";\nimport \""./styles.css\"";\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById(\""root\"")).render(\n  <StrictMode>\n    <App />\n  </StrictMode>\n);\n\n\n=== src/styles.css ===\n:root {\n  font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;\n  color: #1a1a1a;\n  background: #f6f7f9;\n}\n\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\nbody { margin: 0; }\n\n.shell {\n  max-width: 980px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 40px 24px 64px;\n}\n\n.hero {\n  margin-bottom: 32px;\n}\n\n.eyebrow {\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #b45309;\n  margin: 0 0 8px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 2rem;\n  margin: 0 0 12px;\n}\n\n.lede {\n  color: #4b5563;\n  max-width: 720px;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\n\n.grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 20px;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 760px) {\n  .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n}\n\n.panel {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  padding: 20px;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\nh2 { margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: 1.1rem; }\n\n.editor {\n  width: 100%;\n  border: 1px solid #d1d5db;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  padding: 12px;\n  font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  resize: vertical;\n  background: #fafafa;\n}\n\n.actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n\nbutton {\n  border: 1px solid #d1d5db;\n  background: #fff;\n  padding: 8px 14px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n}\n\nbutton.primary { background: #0f172a; border-color: #0f172a; color: #fff; }\nbutton.secondary { background: #f3f4f6; }\n\n.errors {\n  list-style: none;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin: 0;\n  border-left: 4px solid #dc2626;\n  background: #fef2f2;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.errors li {\n  padding: 10px 14px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #fee2e2;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n}\n\n.errors li:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }\n\n.ok {\n  background: #f0fdf4;\n  border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;\n  color: #166534;\n  padding: 10px 14px;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n}\n\n.preview {\n  background: #0f172a;\n  color: #e2e8f0;\n  padding: 14px;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  overflow: auto;\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  max-height: 320px;\n  margin-top: 12px;\n}\n\n.event-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }\n\n.event-card {\n  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 14px;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n  background: #fff;\n}\n\n.event-meta {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 10px;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  color: #6b7280;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\n.badge {\n  background: #eef2ff;\n  color: #4338ca;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  padding: 2px 10px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n.event-card pre {\n  background: #f8fafc;\n  border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  padding: 12px;\n  overflow: auto;\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  line-height: 1.45;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n.schema-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));\n  gap: 14px;\n}\n\n.schema-card {\n  background: #f9fafb;\n  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  padding: 14px;\n}\n\n.schema-card h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 0.95rem; }\n\n.schema-card p { margin: 4px 0; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #4b5563; }\n\n.muted { color: #6b7280; }\n\n\n=== src/workflow/processEvent.js ===\nimport { EVENT_SCHEMA, EMAIL_REGEX, AUSTRALIAN_PHONE_PATTERN, NATIONAL_ID_PATTERN } from './schema.js';\nimport { sanitizeEvent } from './sanitizer.js';\n\nexport function processEvent(raw) {\n  const errors = [];\n\n  if (!raw || typeof raw !== 'object' || Array.isArray(raw)) {\n    return { ok: false, errors: [{ path: 'input', reason: 'Payload must be a JSON object.' }] };\n  }\n\n  const eventType = raw.eventType;\n  if (typeof eventType !== 'string') {\n    return { ok: false, errors: [{ path: 'eventType', reason: 'eventType is required and must be a string.' }] };\n  }\n\n  const schema = EVENT_SCHEMA[eventType];\n  if (!schema) {\n    return {\n      ok: false,\n      errors: [{ path: 'eventType', reason: `eventType must be one of: ${Object.keys(EVENT_SCHEMA).join(', ')}.` }],\n    };\n  }\n\n  for (const key of Object.keys(raw)) {\n    if (!(key in schema.fields)) {\n      errors.push({ path: key, reason: `Field '${key}' is not allowed for event type '${eventType}'.` });\n    }\n  }\n\n  for (const fieldName of schema.required) {\n    if (raw[fieldName] === undefined) {\n      errors.push({ path: fieldName, reason: `Field '${fieldName}' is required.` });\n    }\n  }\n\n  for (const [fieldName, value] of Object.entries(raw)) {\n    const spec = schema.fields[fieldName];\n    if (!spec) continue;\n    if (value === undefined) continue;\n\n    if (value === null) {\n      errors.push({ path: fieldName, reason: `Field '${fieldName}' cannot be null.` });\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    switch (spec.type) {\n      case 'string':\n        if (typeof value !== 'string') {\n          errors.push({ path: fieldName, reason: `Field '${fieldName}' must be a string.` });\n          continue;\n        }\n        if (spec.maxLength && value.length > spec.maxLength) {\n          errors.push({ path: fieldName, reason: `Field '${fieldName}' exceeds ${spec.maxLength} characters.` });\n        }\n        break;\n      case 'email':\n        if (typeof value !== 'string' || !EMAIL_REGEX.test(value.trim())) {\n          errors.push({ path: fieldName, reason: `Field '${fieldName}' must be a valid email address.` });\n          continue;\n        }\n        if (spec.maxLength && value.length > spec.maxLength) {\n          errors.push({ path: fieldName, reason: `Field '${fieldName}' exceeds ${spec.maxLength} characters.` });\n        }\n        break;\n      case 'phone':\n        if (typeof value !== 'string' || !AUSTRALIAN_PHONE_PATTERN.test(value.trim())) {\n          errors.push({\n            path: fieldName,\n            reason: `Field '${fieldName}' must be a valid Australian phone number (e.g. 0412 345 678 or 02 9999 8888).`,\n          });\n          continue;\n        }\n        break;\n      case 'nationalId':\n        if (typeof value !== 'string' || !NATIONAL_ID_PATTERN.test(value.trim())) {\n          errors.push({ path: fieldName, reason: `Field '${fieldName}' must be a valid national identifier string.` });\n          continue;\n        }\n        break;\n      case 'enum':\n        if (typeof value !== 'string' || !spec.values.includes(value)) {\n          errors.push({ path: fieldName, reason: `Field '${fieldName}' must be one of: ${spec.values.join(', ')}.` });\n        }\n        break;\n      default:\n        break;\n    }\n  }\n\n  if (errors.length > 0) {\n    return { ok: false, errors };\n  }\n\n  const sanitized = sanitizeEvent(raw);\n  return { ok: true, event: sanitized };\n}\n\n\n=== src/workflow/sanitizer.js ===\nimport { EVENT_SCHEMA } from './schema.js';\n\nexport const EMAIL_MASK = '***@***.***';\nexport const PHONE_MASK = '*** *** ***';\nexport const NATIONAL_ID_MASK = '***-***-***';\n\nfunction scanAndMaskPii(input) {\n  if (typeof input !== 'string') return input;\n\n  return input\n    .replace(/\\b[A-Z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Z0-9.-]+\\.[A-Z]{2,}\\b/gi, EMAIL_MASK)\n    .replace(/(?:(?:\\+?61[ -]?|0)4\\d{2}[ -]?\\d{3}[ -]?\\d{3})|(?:(?:\\+?61[ -]?|0)[2378][ -]?\\d{4}[ -]?\\d{4})\\b/g, PHONE_MASK)\n    .replace(/(?:\\bTFN\\b|\\btax file number\\b)[\\s:]*\\d{3}[\\s-]?\\d{3}[\\s-]?\\d{3}\\b/gi, NATIONAL_ID_MASK)\n    .replace(/(?:\\bmedicare\\b|\\bmedicare number\\b)[\\s:]*\\d{4}[\\s-]?\\d{5}[\\s-]?\\d{1}\\b/gi, NATIONAL_ID_MASK)\n    .replace(/(?:\\bdriver'?s? licence\\b|\\bdriver license\\b)[\\s:]*[a-z0-9]{6,12}\\b/gi, NATIONAL_ID_MASK);\n}\n\nexport function maskEmail() {\n  return EMAIL_MASK;\n}\n\nexport function maskPhone() {\n  return PHONE_MASK;\n}\n\nexport function maskNationalId() {\n  return NATIONAL_ID_MASK;\n}\n\nexport function sanitizeEvent(event) {\n  const schema = EVENT_SCHEMA[event.eventType];\n  const sanitized = { ...event };\n\n  for (const [key, spec] of Object.entries(schema.fields)) {\n    if (sanitized[key] === undefined) continue;\n\n    if (spec.type === 'email') {\n      sanitized[key] = maskEmail();\n    } else if (spec.type === 'phone') {\n      sanitized[key] = maskPhone();\n    } else if (spec.type === 'nationalId') {\n      sanitized[key] = maskNationalId();\n    } else if (spec.scanPii) {\n      sanitized[key] = scanAndMaskPii(sanitized[key]);\n    }\n  }\n\n  return sanitized;\n}\n\n\n=== src/workflow/schema.js ===\nexport const EVENT_TYPES = {\n  support_ticket: 'Support ticket',\n  employee_update: 'Employee update',\n  incident_report: 'Incident report',\n};\n\nexport const PRIORITY_VALUES = ['low', 'medium', 'high', 'critical'];\n\nexport const EMAIL_REGEX = /^[A-Z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Z0-9.-]+\\.[A-Z]{2,}$/i;\nexport const AUSTRALIAN_PHONE_PATTERN = /^(?:(?:\\+?61[ -]?|0)4\\d{2}[ -]?\\d{3}[ -]?\\d{3}|(?:\\+?61[ -]?|0)[2378][ -]?\\d{4}[ -]?\\d{4})$/;\nexport const NATIONAL_ID_PATTERN = /^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9\\s-]{5,19}$/;\n\nexport const EVENT_SCHEMA = {\n  support_ticket: {\n    required: ['eventType', 'eventId', 'customerEmail', 'description'],\n    fields: {\n      eventType: { type: 'enum', values: ['support_ticket'] },\n      eventId: { type: 'string', maxLength: 64 },\n      customerEmail: { type: 'email', maxLength: 254 },\n      customerName: { type: 'string', maxLength: 120 },\n      phone: { type: 'phone' },\n      nationalId: { type: 'nationalId' },\n      description: { type: 'string', maxLength: 1000, scanPii: true },\n      priority: { type: 'enum', values: PRIORITY_VALUES },\n    },\n  },\n  employee_update: {\n    required: ['eventType', 'eventId', 'employeeEmail', 'fullName'],\n    fields: {\n      eventType: { type: 'enum', values: ['employee_update'] },\n      eventId: { type: 'string', maxLength: 64 },\n      employeeEmail: { type: 'email', maxLength: 254 },\n      fullName: { type: 'string', maxLength: 120 },\n      phone: { type: 'phone' },\n      nationalId: { type: 'nationalId' },\n      note: { type: 'string', maxLength: 1000, scanPii: true },\n      role: { type: 'string', maxLength: 80 },\n    },\n  },\n  incident_report: {\n    required: ['eventType', 'eventId', 'reporterEmail', 'summary'],\n    fields: {\n      eventType: { type: 'enum', values: ['incident_report'] },\n      eventId: { type: 'string', maxLength: 64 },\n      reporterEmail: { type: 'email', maxLength: 254 },\n      reporterPhone: { type: 'phone' },\n      reporterNationalId: { type: 'nationalId' },\n      summary: { type: 'string', maxLength: 2000, scanPii: true },\n      severity: { type: 'enum', values: ['minor', 'major', 'critical'] },\n    },\n  },\n};\n\n\n=== vite.config.js ===\nimport { defineConfig } from \""vite\"";\n\n// No @vitejs/plugin-react on purpose: esbuild compiles JSX, which keeps\n// `npm install` fast inside the browser sandbox.\nexport default defineConfig({\n  esbuild: { jsx: \""automatic\"" },\n});\n\n</files>\n\nEvaluate now. Return every requirement id exactly once.""}]}","","{""response_format"":""{\""type\"":\""json_object\""}"",""challengeTitle"":""Unknown — Resilient API Gateway with Australian Privacy Masking"",""maxTokens"":""24000"",""effort"":""high"",""stage"":""evaluator""}","","","[""evaluation"",""evaluator""]","140599a636cf63b237b309c9061d5be9d53ade3f","","[]"
